 MAX_DOTS_PER_FRAME.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/8f215267.py:120:    \"\"\"Grow a connected polyomino of the given area inside an h x w bounding box.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/8f215267.py:135:    \"\"\"Generate a small random connected sprite, tight-cropped to its bounding box.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/8f215267.py:204:def generate_input() -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/62593bfd.py:8:    \"\"\"Local helper: build a boolean mask from bbox-relative component coordinates.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/62593bfd.py:20:    \"\"\"Canonicalize a boolean mask up to rotation and horizontal reflection.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/62593bfd.py:31:def main(grid: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/62593bfd.py:32:    \"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/62593bfd.py:35:    Input structure:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/62593bfd.py:39:    Rule:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/62593bfd.py:45:    Key insight: The sorting criterion is shape frequency (rotation-invariant), not area — duplicated shapes go up, unique shapes go down.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/62593bfd.py:46:    \"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/62593bfd.py:113:    \"\"\"Return all (h, w) bboxes where area fits with fill_ratio >= MIN_FILL_RATIO_X10/10.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/62593bfd.py:132:    \"\"\"Create a seed mask along a diagonal line spanning the bbox, randomly flipped.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/62593bfd.py:153:    \"\"\"Grow an 8-connected mask from a line seed to the target area.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/62593bfd.py:169:    \"\"\"Paint a boolean mask into a colored patch on a bg-filled array.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/62593bfd.py:176:    \"\"\"Generate a random 8-connected component with the given area and color.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/62593bfd.