ly target_rooms enclosed regions.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/89565ca0.py:320:    \"\"\"Try to reposition frame j so it overlaps frame i. Modifies positions in place.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/89565ca0.py:341:    \"\"\"Render frame walls onto grid; return grid and set of visible frame pixel coords.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/89565ca0.py:367:    \"\"\"Place noise pixels on non-wall cells and damage some wall cells.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/89565ca0.py:390:    \"\"\"Single attempt to generate a valid puzzle grid.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/89565ca0.py:475:def generate_input() -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/898e7135.py:6:def main(grid: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/898e7135.py:7:    \"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/898e7135.py:10:    Input structure:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/898e7135.py:14:    Rule:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/898e7135.py:19:    Key insight: Pieces are k×k-block-scaled versions of holes; downsampling reveals shape matches under all 8 orientations.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/898e7135.py:20:    \"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/898e7135.py:156:\"\"\"Generator for ARC-AGI-2 task 898e7135.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/898e7135.py:167:\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/898e7135.py:202:    \"\"\"Canonical bytes representation under D4 for a bool mask (tight-cropped).\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/898e7135.py:213:    \"\"\"Grow a 4-conn slot of given size starting from a random free cell.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/898e7135.py:215:    \"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/898e7135.py:240:    \"\"\"Dilate a bool mask by 1 cell (8-connectivity).\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/898e7135.py:254:    \"\"\"Mark coords and their 8-neighbors as forbidden (in-place).\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eva